  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>A</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>B</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is a constant of integration, then <math><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math> equals&nbsp;"
  },
